Title: [WIP] Prepare for NVIDIA Certified Professional: AI Operations (NCP-AIO) Exam
Date: 2026-XX-XX
Category: Knowledge Base
Tags: nvidia, hpc, ai, certification, devops, slurm, kubernetes

TLDR: OUTLINE — roadmap for article 54. Follow-up to article 53 (NCA-AIIO). Format is deliberately different: symptom-driven runbook instead of blueprint-driven phases, because that is how NCP-AIO asks questions and how ops people actually search. Part 6 is already written as real content; everything else is outline.

